<title>GERMANY: Daimler to publish 9-mo sales figs Thursday.</title>
<headline>Daimler to publish 9-mo sales figs Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG will publish nine-month sales figures on Thursday morning around 0630 GMT, a Daimler spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>The industrial conglomorate will break down sales figures for each of its major units, but will not publish profit figures -- numbers it only releases at the half- and full-year stage.</p>
<p>In 1995, Daimler reported sales of 103.5 billion marks, but analysts generally look for higher turnover this year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
